replacement access road (HJWAccess Road) that HJW constructed at iscost per the Easement
and the City removedas apart of the construction of itslandfill.
First, a point of clarification: access to the HJW turbines isa part of the operation and
maintenance of the HJ W wind energy system.Second, the previous HJWAccess Road that was
removedby the City.This HJWAccess Road was part of the HJWwind energy project, aroad
